[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5927193005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124055#issuecomment-5927193005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124055","id":5927193005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYUnJrQ","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T07:52:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T07:52:24Z","body":"Keeping as draft while I investigate implicit conversion. \r\n\r\nThere are a few call-sites that now use implicit conversion from `Script *` to `Variant` via the `Variant(const Object *)` constructor. There is however a difference in behaviour. `get_script` would return a `NIL` variant if the script is null whereas the new implicit conversion would be `OBJECT` typed.\r\n\r\nI may end up removing these changes to make this PR safer. I believe these are all in the editor so they are not performance sensitive.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5927193005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh"